WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
[Electronic music, quickening clicks]
“Can you quote this by Friday?”

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.750
You don’t need an AI strategy.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.300
You need Tuesday’s enquiries answered.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.540
Start with one useful task.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.800
It reads Dana’s roof enquiry.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.060
It drafts a reply to Dana.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.500
You decide. [Click]
Approve and send.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.300
Build from there, inside your team’s tools.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.000
Put AI to work.
